msgctxt "ActionTransient:17000:0:0"
msgid "Restores target's HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1300"
msgstr "Восстанавливает HP цели.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Сила лечения:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1300"

#. ja: 自身と周囲のパーティメンバーのＨＰを回復する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>回復力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>500
#. de: Du regenerierst eigene LP und die von umstehenden Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>gliedern.<br>Heilpotenzial: 500
#. fr: Restaure vos PV et ceux des équipiers alentour.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 500
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
