msgid "Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Nascent Chaos</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>5s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Charges: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>2"
