msgid "Allows the firing of successive rounds with your gunblade.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gnashing Fang</ui-edge-color></ui-color> may be followed by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Jugular Rip</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Savage Claw</ui-edge-color></ui-color> may be followed by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Abdomen Tear</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Wicked Talon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> may be followed by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Eye Gouge</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
