msgid "Reduces damage taken by self and nearby party members by 10%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>When under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Brutal Shell</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, its effect is doubled and granted to nearby party members<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s"
