msgctxt "ActionTransient:17718:0:0"
msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 600 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Bind</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>3s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dualcast</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when spell is cast with a cast time<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s<br>This action does not share a recast timer with any other actions."
