msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 2,600.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Kenki Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 20<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Meditation</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Can be stacked up to 3 times.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Charges: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>2<br>Can only be executed following <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Midare Setsugekka</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>This weaponskill does not share a recast timer with any other actions.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
