msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 1,000.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Esprit Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 10<br><br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Reverse Cascade</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>En Avant</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Emboite</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while dancing.<br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
