msgid "Restores target's HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 4,000<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Regen</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 400<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Nourishes the <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Blood Lily</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Healing Gauge Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>1 <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lily</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>A <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lily</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is granted every 10 seconds while in combat."
