msgid "Restores target's HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>3,000<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Regen</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>600<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s"
