msgid "Increases damage dealt and healing potency by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Reduces the recast time of both <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Lustrate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Indomitability</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 15s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Faerie Gauge Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>50"
